                    </title>
                    <desc id="profile-desc">
                      The plated band is thicker at edges and thinner inside a
                      recess, following current density rather than the drawing.
                    </desc>

                    <path
                      d="M60 220 L60 170 L110 170 L110 190 L250 190 L250 170 L300 170 L300 220 Z"
                      fill="var(--color-paper-2)"
                      stroke="var(--color-line)"
                      stroke-width="1"
                    ></path>

                    <line
                      x1="60"
                      y1="166"
                      x2="108"
                      y2="166"
                      stroke="var(--color-gold)"
                      stroke-width="8"
                    ></line>
                    <line
